WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.800
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and game of thrones
just posted it’s second trailer for season

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.650
4 with some new footage so just like last
time I wanted to do a breakdown of all the

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:16.650
new stuff.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.340
In case you’re finding me for the first
time I’ll be doing a special season 4 countdown

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.162
video series starting in about two weeks.

00:00:22.162 --> 00:00:23.162
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:25.610
I’ll be doing histories of the great houses,
character videos and what ever else you guys

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.079
want to see.

00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:32.970
I’m also doing a Q&amp;A video Monday, so I’ll
be picking 10 or 11 questions from the comments

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:33.970
on this video to answer in a video.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.880
Careful for potential spoilers in case you
don’t want to know anything.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.980
Now on to the important stuff, somebody blow
the dragon horn.

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.629
First, the big difference is the voice over
narration.

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:47.210
Arya starts by saying her prayer and explaining
it to the hound.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.079
She adds names to it as she goes along.

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:52.140
So by the end of this season, there will be
more names on it.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:55.100
Then there’s the first shot of styr, the
magnar of thenn.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.550
He’s played by Joseph Gatt.

00:00:56.550 --> 00:01:00.820
A lot of his parts from book 3 were given
to the lord of bones last season, but he’s

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:04.110
finally arrived to the party.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:08.520
Number 3Then sophie turner shares a post-red
wedding moment with tyrion.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.830
She didnt’ have a lot of time to grieve
as her wedding to tyrion was kind of rushed.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.950
She had a lot to cry about last season, but
it seems like she’s mostly over the tyrion

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.909
part and is just grieving about her family
now.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:20.390
Number 4 - Jon Snow talks about the old bear
being murdered by burn gorman and the other

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.549
rogue night’s watchmen.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.840
Burn Gorman is actually returning this season.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.509
So Jon may get a chance to revenge.

00:01:26.509 --> 00:01:31.950
If you didn’t know Jeor Mormot is the father
of ser jorah mormot who’s serving dany in

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.189
the east right now.

00:01:33.189 --> 00:01:36.649
Number 5 - There’s the first speaking scene
from Stannis.

00:01:36.649 --> 00:01:40.719
He’s drunk Melisandre’s kool-aide so much
that he’s dedicated to the idea of this

00:01:40.719 --> 00:01:44.240
epic war between the red god and the great
other.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:49.540
I always love how all of his scenes usually
have burning flame in them.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:53.810
Number 6 - Here’s a shot of dany’s legions
unsullied attacking mereen.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.780
It’s hard to tell until you see that bit
of debri fly by.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:00.650
Number 7 - Here’s another shot of the wilding
seige against the night’s watch.

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:05.210
Number 8 - There’s a voice over and scene
from littlefinger talking to sansa about revenge.

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:09.740
If there’s anything littlefinger has been
good at it’s the art of the long con.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:13.090
He’s like the great gatsby type person of
game of thrones.

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:16.480
He loved catyln stark but she was too far
above him.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.880
So he rose to power and dedicated himself
to crushing the people he hated like the baratheons

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:25.230
and the lannisters and creating a world where
he would be able to be with her.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.870
And ended up going a little mad in the process.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:32.310
Number 9 - Cersei spits tyrion’s line back
in his face.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:35.870
The day will come when your joy will turn
to ashes in your mouth and you will know the

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:40.690
debt is paid. is something tyrion said to
her during season 2.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:44.490
Number 10 - This is the first shot of shae
we’ve seen in season 4.

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:49.850
It cuts trait to a scene of tywin which for
book readers is a huge teaser of a major plot

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:50.850
point.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.050
So I won’t say what it is.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:55.490
Number 11 - Dany declares that she will rule.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:59.530
This is her dedicating herself to fixing the
problems of slavering and terrible government

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:00.530
in the east.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:04.390
She’s faced with the choice of abandoning
her quest for the iron throne or helping all

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:05.970
the people she’s liberated.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:09.590
Number 12 - And it ends on a shot of a white
walker.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:13.520
This is the first season 4 shot we’ve seen
of one and it looks like a different one than

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.730
we saw last year.

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:17.730
So they may have changed the makeup effects
just to make them all a little more unique.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.730
Because white walkers are just a different
race of people just like the other nations

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.730
of essos.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.810
So looking at all this it looks like they’re
really pushing the valar morghulis theme this

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:22.810
season.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.570
ALL men must die, as in everyone must die.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:28.640
Special shout out for dany’s line from last
season though, when she responded “yes but

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.090
we are not men”.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.870
So now it’s your turn, let me know what
your favorite moment was from the new trailer.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:33.870
And what are your biggest questions.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.700
I have to say my favorite shot was definitely
them giving cersei tyrion’s line and that

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.890
last shot of the white walker.

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:43.590
Remember I’ll be picking your questions
from the comments to include in my Q&amp;A video

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.430
